  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "プラモデル制作には欠かせない「ニッパー」「ピンセット」「パーツセパレーター」がセットになって登場！",
      "en": "Introducing a set of \"nippers \", \" tweezers \", and \" parts separators\" that are essential for plastic model production!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデル入門者にオススメのベーシック仕様。",
      "en": "• Basic specifications recommended for beginners to plastic models."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 初めてプラモデルを購入する方へ向けたニッパーは、使い心地にこだわったプラモデル専用。",
      "en": "• Nippers for those who are purchasing a plastic model for the first time are designed specifically for plastic models with a focus on comfort."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シールをキレイに貼るために必須のツールであるピンセットと、間違えてはめ込んでしまったパーツを分解できるパーツセパレーターも同梱。",
      "en": "• Includes tweezers, an essential tool for applying the Seal neatly, and a parts separator that can be used to disassemble parts that have been inserted by mistake."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ピンセットとパーツセパレーターはシールやパーツを傷つけにくい樹脂製。",
      "en": "• The tweezers and parts separator are made of resin that won't easily damage the seal or parts."
    }
